        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>数学应用题解答</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background-color: #f5f3ee;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px 30px;\n    font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Segoe Print\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f5f3ee;\n    padding: 10px 15px;\n  }\n  .question {\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-top: 22px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .question .qtext {\n    color: #c0392b;\n  }\n  .question .qtext.wrap {\n    display: block;\n    margin-left: 1.2em;\n  }\n  .subhead {\n    color: #222;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin: 6px 0 8px 0.5em;\n  }\n  .line {\n    color: #222;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin: 6px 0 6px 1.5em;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .indent2 {\n    margin-left: 2.2em;\n  }\n  .answer-row {\n    margin: 6px 0 6px 1.5em;\n  }\n  .answer-row span {\n    display: inline-block;\n    min-width: 130px;\n  }\n  hr.sep {\n    display: none;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- Question 2 -->\n  <div class=\"question\">\n    2. 光明小学师生100人共画了100幅画，老师1人画3幅，学生3人1幅，\n    <span class=\"qtext wrap\">画画的老师、学生各有多少人？</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"subhead\">分组法</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">1个老师和3个学生画画的幅数：&nbsp;&nbsp;3+1=4(幅)</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">共100幅画，每4幅为一组，共分的组数：100÷4=25(组)</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">\n    <span class=\"answer-row\"><span>老师：25×1=25（人）</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;学生：25×3=75（人）</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Question 3 -->\n  <div class=\"question\">\n    3.鸡兔共笼，鸡比兔多26只，脚数共有274只，鸡兔各有多少只？\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"subhead\">分组法</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">去掉26只鸡，脚数减少：26×2=52(只)</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">脚数尚剩下：&nbsp;&nbsp;274－52=222(只)</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">把1只鸡和1只兔看作1组</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">每组里脚数：&nbsp;&nbsp;2+4=6(只)</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">222只脚可分成：222÷6=37(组)</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">\n    <span class=\"answer-row\"><span>鸡：37×1+26=63(只)</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;兔：37×1=37(只)</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Question 4 -->\n  <div class=\"question\">\n    4. 100个和尚吃100个馒头。大和尚一人吃3个，小和尚3人吃一个，\n    <span class=\"qtext wrap\">大、小和尚各多少人？</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"subhead\">分组法</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">1个大和尚和3个小和尚共吃的馒头个数：&nbsp;&nbsp;3+1=4(个)</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">共100个馒头，每4个馒头为一组，共分的组数：100÷4=25(组)</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">大和尚：25×1=25（人）</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">小和尚：25×3=75（人）</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
